  ABYSS_SHEET_DONOR_PORT_1. The aveluthia: one of the Abyss's black, many-eyed kin, the crags' pack beast. Owned
  port of the Alpha Animals nightmule (sarg.alphaanimals AA_NightMule, 1.6/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/Races_NighMule.xml);
  name and description are the owner's sheet ruling 2026-10-05. Free RM_ tier, ONE HOME: the Abyss. Stats, tools,
  race fields and pawnkind numbers are the donor's own, EXCEPT these donor-only references:
    - body AA_NightMuleBody -> vanilla QuadrupedAnimalWithHoovesAndHorn (same tool groups)
    - leatherDef Leather_Night -> Leather_Plain (PROVISIONAL substitute)
    - the VEF stat extension dropped; the horns tool is relabelled "snout" to match the description
      (it has no horns); meatLabel "dark marbled steak" kept.
  ART: abyss_aveluthia_v3 (east/south/north, finished in the artpipe), installed 2026-10-06 via the art ledger at the texPath below.
